                "body": "```bash\n# Test script to verify wordcount behavior\n\n# 1. Create a sample file\nmkdir -p /tmp/wordcount_test\necho \"hello world\" > /tmp/wordcount_test/sample.txt\necho \"foo bar baz\" >> /tmp/wordcount_test/sample.txt\n\n# 2. Run against existing file\npython3 wordcount.py /tmp/wordcount_test/sample.txt\necho \"Exit code for existing file: $?\"\n\n# 3. Run against non-existent file\npython3 wordcount.py /tmp/wordcount_test/nonexistent.txt\necho \"Exit code for missing file: $?\"\n\n# 4. Run against mixed files (one good, one bad)\npython3 wordcount.py /tmp/wordcount_test/sample.txt /tmp/wordcount_test/nonexistent.txt\necho \"Exit code for mixed: $?\"\n```",
                "origin_task": "Verify CLI behavior and output format"
